WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:08.663
Choose how often devices check for updates and send reports. The
right cadence depends on your needs and the cost of device
activity.

2
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:15.074
Open Fleet settings. Choose update and report intervals; daily
reporting is not live monitoring.

3
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:20.938
Review the estimate, then save your settings. Saving does not
deposit operating funds.

4
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:28.421
This example shows a budget warning. Saving records the settings
only; add funds separately before they are needed.

5
00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:34.471
Devices apply the settings at their next check. Their operating
funds remain in Network budget.

6
00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.642
Your settings are saved for the next device check. Keep the
operating budget funded separately as you continue managing the
fleet.
